{"version":1,"id":"UCYkXINQ9X-Xbks98J2aEupQ","name":"The Horse's Heartbeat","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYkXINQ9X-Xbks98J2aEupQ","main":true,"sourceId":"9111b33d-b595-42f9-876d-5cb1146826e9","profile":{"channelId":"UCYkXINQ9X-Xbks98J2aEupQ","name":"The Horse's Heartbeat","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYkXINQ9X-Xbks98J2aEupQ","handle":"@thehorsesheartbeat","description":"The Horse's Heartbeat offers Equine Assisted Therapy and Equine Assisted Learning for individuals and groups in Little River, Victoria (located within easy access of Geelong and Melbourne). \nOur learning, counselling and psychotherapy sessions are beneficial for children, adolescents and adults. We support clients in areas including anxiety, depression, trauma, emotional dysregulation and mental wellbeing. We offer innovative and experiential programs to support clients to become aware, relaxed, and able to step into their best life. \nWe have a herd of six horses - two miniature ponies and four 'big' horses. The Horse's Heartbeat equine herd are valued and their welfare is at the core of all of our work. Our horses are treated ethically, kindly and are free to express their boundaries, even while engaging in their therapy and learning work with clients. Through this, we know that the connections and relationships between horse and human truly reflect a genuine, unforced interaction.","thumbnailUrl":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wZQBNXqbLljVX0jEpEF8lG8RouLqaHOo0FpZlo9MYknO3QTYs4SqAGL8LfCysy9ycxLc3EVX=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","subscriberText":"80 subscribers","videoCountText":"22 videos","countrySelfReported":"Australia","links":[{"title":"The Horse's Heartbeat","url":"https://thehorsesheartbeat.com/","displayedText":"thehorsesheartbeat.com"}],"observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:20:32.196Z","source":"youtubejs"},"assessment":{"channelId":"UCYkXINQ9X-Xbks98J2aEupQ","relevance":"strong","role":"organization","verdict":"keep","intentIds":["equine-therapist-human","career"],"reasons